    "label": "12",
    "prompt": "Jane has just received her first credit card, and has already used it to buy some clothes. The balance is $-\\$140$. She spends another $\\$70$ at the grocery store the next day. At the end of the week, she will be paid $\\$280$. If she uses this to pay off her credit card, how much will Jane have left?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "Jane will have $\\$70$ left.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}-140-70+280&=-210+280\\\\-140-70+280&=70\\end{align*}$$\nJane will have $\\$70$ left after paying off her credit card.",
